Subject: [PATCH 1/4] Add pi05_so101 config for SO101 single-arm fine-tuning

- so101_policy.py: SO101 input/output transforms (6-DOF, top+wrist cameras,
  third image slot masked).
- config.py: LeRobotSO101DataConfig + pi05_so101 TrainConfig (pi05_base weights,
  delta actions on 5 joints, prompt_from_task). Add DataConfig.episodes field to
  exclude bad episodes (6,9,33,34,43,48,52) -> 58 of 65 episodes trained.
- data_loader.py: pass episodes= through to the LeRobot dataset.

